  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      178.05,
      204.65,
      385.75,
      230.63
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE INSTITUTE OF QUANTITY SURVEYORS,SRI LANKA (INCORPORATION) ACT, NO. 20 OF 2007",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      248.45,
      401.89,
      289.07
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS it has become necessary, inter alia, to alter theCorporate Membership categories and associated names ofMembers of the Institute of Quantity Surveyors, Sri Lanka:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      306.89,
      401.89,
      391.19
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Institute of Quantity Surveyors,Sri Lanka has requested making of necessary amendmentsto the Institute of Quantity Surveyors, Sri Lanka(Incorporation) Act to provide for above requirements andmatters incidental thereto and it is expendient to affect suchamendment:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      409.13,
      401.88,
      434.99
    ],
    "text": "NOW BE it enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      452.93,
      401.86,
      493.43
    ],
    "text": "1. (1) This Act may be cited as the Institute of QuantitySurveyors, Sri Lanka (Incorporation) (Amendment)Act, No. of 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      511.25,
      401.88,
      537.23
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 13 of the principal enactment is herebyamended as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      179.85,
      555.05,
      401.89,
      668.63
    ],
    "text": "(i)by renumbering the existing subsections (2), (3)and (4) of that section as (3), (4) and (5), respectively,and insertion of the following as subsection (2) ofthat section, the words, \u201cEvery member of theCorporation who is registered as a Honorary LifeFellow of the Corporation shall be entitled to usethe abbreviated designation \u2018Hony. LFIQS.SL\u2019 afterhis or her name\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      409.29,
      454.39,
      443.74,
      463.46
    ],
    "text": "Short title",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
