      204.53,
      397.17,
      244.43
    ],
    "text": "(ii)by deleting the letters \u201cF.I.Q.S.SL\u201d of re-numberedsubsection (3) of that section thereof and insertionof the letters \u201cFIQS.SL\u201d therein;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.15,
      261.41,
      397.2,
      343.31
    ],
    "text": "(iii)by the repeal of re-numbered subsection 4 of thatsection, and insertion of following as subsection(4) thereof, the words \u201cEvery member of theCorporation who is registered as a Member of theCorporation shall be entitled to use the abbreviateddesignation \u2018MIQS.SL\u2019 after his or her name\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.87,
      360.17,
      397.19,
      540.71
    ],
    "text": "(iv)by the repeal of re-numbered subsection (5) of thatsection, and insertion of following as subsection(5) thereof, the words \u201cWhere majority of thepartners or directors and shareholders of a firm orCompany of Quantity Surveyors who possess thequalifications to be specified in the rules to be madeunder section 7 of this Act, are members of theCorporation, such firm or Company may bepermitted by the Council to use the title \u201cCharteredQuantity Surveyor\u201d or \u201cChartered QuantitySurveyors\u201d as the case may be, upon a request madein that behalf by such firm or company to theCouncil.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      557.57,
      397.16,
      597.11
    ],
    "text": "(v)by insertion of following subsection immediatelyafter re-numbered subsection (5) as subsection (6)respectively of the principal enactment:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      214.15,
      613.49,
      397.19,
      666.23
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(6) Subject to the provisions of this Act, noperson shall practice, employ, be employedor publicly display any name, title or stylecontaining any of the words or phrases",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
